      <title>2026-08-11 早报：利物浦官宣阿劳霍；恩德里克将留皇马；小蜘蛛被马竞放鸽子</title>
      <link>https://m.zhibo8.com//news/web/zuqiu/2026-08-11/6a7a19e760b81native.htm</link>
      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【利物浦租借阿劳霍】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-11/6a79eeac00e80native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：利物浦租借巴萨中卫阿劳霍，承担100%薪水+5500万选择买断</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608081634335361.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608081634335361.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608081634335361.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，利物浦租借27岁巴萨中后卫阿劳霍，租期一个赛季。阿劳霍将身披33号球衣。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-11/6a7a0c4a7fcf8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿劳霍：非常高兴加盟利物浦这家伟大俱乐部 这是现阶段理想一步</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-11/6a7a15ddcfd80native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：阿劳霍接受降薪以获得稳定出场时间，利物浦将全额承担薪资</a></p><p><strong>【热点新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-11/6a7a213018a6anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">不外租！罗马诺：皇马决定留用恩德里克，穆里尼奥也批准了该计划</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260811/202608110322456489.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260811/202608110322456489.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260811/202608110322456489.jpg"> </div><p>据罗马诺消息，皇马已告知恩德里克及其经纪人，俱乐部决定留用这名球员。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-11/6a7a173ee0281native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">世体：小蜘蛛对未能与西蒙尼交谈很不满 告诉球队不要再指望他</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260409/69d769d6bbb93.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260409/69d769d6bbb93.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260409/69d769d6bbb93.jpg"> </div><p>《世界体育报》报道，阿尔瓦雷斯非常不满，他归队后想和俱乐部商谈离队一事，但西蒙尼和CEO马林今天都不在俱乐部。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-11/6a7a124969029native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：马竞与罗梅罗接近达协议并将向热刺报价，球员愿意加盟</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260811/202608110205442562_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260811/202608110205442562_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260811/202608110205442562_720.jpg"> </div><p>据罗马诺消息，罗梅罗与马竞接近达成协议，新报价即将提交热刺。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-11/6a7a1eaf7cf4bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿斯：面对国米、阿森纳的邀约，罗梅罗最终选择了加盟马竞</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260413/69dd052ebfd38.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260413/69dd052ebfd38.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260413/69dd052ebfd38.jpg"> </div><p>据西媒阿斯报报道，马竞总监阿莱曼尼希望未来数小时内敲定罗梅罗的转会。西蒙尼期盼尽早迎来自己麾下的全新后防领袖，最好能赶上西甲新赛季开赛。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-11/6a7a2f588de1bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">涨薪续约！官方：25岁后卫范德芬与热刺续约5年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260811/202608110411184037_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260811/202608110411184037_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260811/202608110411184037_720.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，25岁后卫范德芬与热刺续约5年。此前据罗马诺报道，新合同将涨薪。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-11/6a7a0f18a8382native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：25岁阿根廷国脚阿尔马达与河床签至2030年，转会费2000万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.25" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260811/202608110152287468_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.25" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.25" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260811/202608110152287468_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260811/202608110152287468_720.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，河床签下25岁阿根廷国脚阿尔马达，合同合约有效期至2030年12月31日。此前据罗马诺报道，转会费为2000万欧元。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-11/6a79f529ba532native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">OPTA超算预测新赛季西甲夺冠概率：巴萨45.6%，皇马31%，马竞8.6%</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="2" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260811/202608110003265108.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="2" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="2" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260811/202608110003265108.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260811/202608110003265108.jpg"> </div><p>OPTA超级计算机的在对西甲新赛季的预测中看好巴萨夺冠，红蓝军团夺冠概率为45.6%，而皇马则为31%。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-11/6a79fac0b0ee9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">塞尔：穆里尼奥希望再签一名中场和一名中后卫，也还会有球员离队</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260802/6a6ee78585f3d_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260802/6a6ee78585f3d.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260802/6a6ee78585f3d.jpg"> </div><p>塞尔电台消息，在罗德里拒绝加盟后，皇马并未关闭转会大门，俱乐部正在评估引进一名中场球员及一名中后卫。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-11/6a7a2ec1197bdnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿媒：梅西决定暂时放下工作，将全部重心放在陪伴家人身上</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260811/202608110408006229.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260811/202608110408006229_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260811/202608110408006229_720.jpg"> </div><p>据阿根廷媒体《Doble Amarilla》报道，梅西打算暂时放下工作，将重心放在陪伴家人。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-11/6a79f5ef21588native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">安保文件曝光！太阳报：世界杯有人扬言要炸梅西 C罗也遭安全威胁</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.47" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260726/6a65a0ff2765a_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.47" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.47" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260726/6a65a0ff2765a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260726/6a65a0ff2765a.jpg"> </div><p>英媒《太阳报》援引西班牙《信息报》的消息报道，在世界杯半决赛对阵阿根廷赛前，有人称英格兰队大巴有炸弹；此外梅西和C罗都曾受到安全威胁。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-11/6a7a11731f518native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">足坛锡伯杜？BBC：伊劳拉训练强度极大 有球员训练后身体难受反胃</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.25" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260413/69dce2482cc56.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.25" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.25" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260413/69dce2482cc56.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260413/69dce2482cc56.jpg"> </div><p>英媒BBC谈到了利物浦新帅伊劳拉的训练强度，有球员透露，最初几堂训练课后身体难受反胃。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-10/6a79e967f4202native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">穆帅再谈伊娃事件！伊娃发文暗讽：我要宣布“一则特别的消息”</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260810/202608102324199034.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260810/202608102324199034.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260810/202608102324199034.jpg"> </div><p>英媒邮报报道，前切尔西队医伊娃在社媒发文暗指穆帅，起因是穆里尼奥在Netflix纪录片中谈及了那场著名的边线争执，并拒绝道歉。</p><a href="http://m.zhibo8.cc/topic/in